 *
 * A parsed reference is a plain object:
 *   scheme:    string | undefined  (undefined means absent, not just empty)
 *   hasAuthority: boolean
 *   userinfo:  string | undefined  (only meaningful when hasAuthority)
 *   host:      string | undefined  (defined whenever hasAuthority is true)
 *   port:      string | undefined  (only meaningful when hasAuthority)
 *   path:      string              (always present, possibly empty)
 *   query:     string | undefined
 *   fragment:  string | undefined
